     On success, function ddwwaarrff__aadddd__ffrraammee__cciiee() returns the index value of the
     created common information entry.  In case of an error, function
     ddwwaarrff__aadddd__ffrraammee__cciiee() returns DW_DLV_NOCOUNT and sets the argument _e_r_r.

