     Function ddwwaarrff__aadddd__ffrraammee__cciiee() can fail with:

     [DW_DLE_ARGUMENT]  Argument _d_b_g was NULL.

     [DW_DLE_MEMORY]    An out of memory condition was encountered during the
                        execution of the function.

